{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51584","headline":"明德舞（後周宗庙乐舞辞。太祖庙堂） · 田敏","name":"明德舞（後周宗庙乐舞辞。太祖庙堂）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"《五代会要》七《庙乐》曰：「太祖圣神齿数肃文武孝皇帝庙室酌献舞《明德之舞》，登歌乐章一首，太常卿田敏撰。\n（参《旧五代史》一四四《乐志》）」惟彼岐阳，德大流光。\n载造周室，泽及遐荒。\n於铄圣祖，上帝是皇。\n乃圣乃神，知微知章。\n新庙弈弈，丰年穰穰。\n取彼血膋，以往烝尝。\n黍稷惟声，笾豆大房。\n工祝致告，受福无疆。\n（《乐府诗集》十二《郊庙歌辞》）（《全唐诗》卷十六《郊庙歌辞》收入，不署作者。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"田敏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51584.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51584","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}